"keykey.uninstall.item.trashAllUsers" = "Not Yahoo! KeyKey 2 itself: installed for all users, it stays in /Library/Input Methods until you drag it to the Trash in Finder (which asks for an administrator password), or run brew uninstall --cask yahoo-keykey-2 if Homebrew installed it";
